body	O	81354d90	## 책임\n흐름이 함께 쓰는 store · 모델 표 · 사양 파일 묶음. 파일 다시 읽기(refresh), 쓰기 마무리(finish), ID 찾기(resolve) 를 한다.\n\n## 모듈 인터페이스\n```cpp\n// struct Workspace\nKiottySpecStatus reload();\nKiottySpecStatus refresh();\nKiottySpecStatus finish(KiottySpecStatus status);\nResult<entity::ItemHandle, KiottySpecStatus> resolve(Span<const char> id);\n// 함수\nstatic_assert(sizeof(Workspace) == 64, "unexpected padding");\n```\n\n## 멤버 변수\n```cpp\n// Workspace\nSpecFile& file;\nentity::Failure& failure;\nconst ModelCatalog& catalog;\nMetaStore& meta;\nCheckpointStore& checkpoints;\nItemStore& items;\nRelationStore& relations;\nDecisionStore& decisions;\n```\n\n## 의존 모듈\n- DSN-022 Failure\n- DSN-035 text_view\n- DSN-046 CheckpointStore\n- DSN-048 DecisionStore\n- DSN-051 ItemStore\n- DSN-055 MetaStore\n- DSN-056 RelationStore\n- DSN-065 ModelCatalog\n- DSN-068 SpecFile\n
body	O	81639d02	```cpp\nusing ServerResult = Result<ServerHandle, ErrorCode>;\n\nServerResult createServer(Context& context, const ServerConfiguration& configuration)\n{\n    Handle handle = context.servers.acquire();\n    if (!handle.valid()) { return ServerResult::failure(ErrorCode::POOL_IS_FULL); }\n\n    auto server = context.servers.get(handle);\n    if (!server) { return ServerResult::failure(server.code); }\n\n    ErrorCode code = server.value.initialize(configuration);\n    if (code != ErrorCode::SUCCESS) { return ServerResult::failure(code); }\n\n    return ServerResult::success(handle);\n}\n```\n
