body	O	8553ef57	## 책임\n관계 버전 표와 현재 관계 풀 (설계서 v1 3.5, 10.1). 풀은 (from index, relation, to index) 순으로 정렬해 둔다.\n\n타입: RelationEnd, RelationDependencies, RelationWriter, RelationStore\n\n## 모듈 인터페이스\n```cpp\n// class RelationWriter\nRelationWriter(RelationDependencies dependencies, VersionTable<entity::RelationVersion>& versions, std::vector<entity::RelationRecord>& records, size_t& length);\nKiottySpecStatus add(const entity::RelationRecord& relation, uint32_t sequence);\nKiottySpecStatus remove(const entity::RelationRecord& relation, uint32_t sequence);\nKiottySpecStatus removeAllOf(entity::ItemHandle item, uint32_t sequence);\n// class RelationStore\nRelationStore(entity::Failure& failure, ItemStore& items, size_t capacity, size_t versions);\nVersionTable<entity::RelationVersion>& versions();\nSpan<const uint32_t> relationsInDiffOrder();\nKiottySpecStatus rebuild();\nSpan<const entity::RelationRecord> all() const;\nbool contains(const entity::RelationRecord& relation) const;\nvoid countEnds(RelationEnd end, Span<uint32_t> counts) const;\nRelationWriter writer();\n// 함수\nstatic_assert(sizeof(RelationEnd) == 12, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(RelationDependencies) == 16, "unexpected padding");\n```\n\n## 멤버 변수\n```cpp\n// RelationEnd\nentity::ItemKind model {};\nuint32_t relation {};\nRelationSide side {RelationSide::FROM};\n// RelationDependencies\nentity::Failure& failure;\nItemStore& items;\n// RelationWriter\nentity::Failure& _failure;\nItemStore& _items;\nVersionTable<entity::RelationVersion>& _versions;\nstd::vector<entity::RelationRecord>& _records;\nsize_t& _length;\n// RelationStore\nentity::Failure& _failure;\nItemStore& _items;\nVersionTable<entity::RelationVersion> _versions;\nstd::vector<entity::RelationRecord> _records;\nsize_t _length {0};\nstd::vector<uint32_t> _order;\n```\n\n## 의존 모듈\n- DSN-022 Failure\n- DSN-029 Result\n- DSN-032 Span\n- DSN-038 VersionTable\n- DSN-051 ItemStore\n- DSN-058 item_records\n- DSN-061 version_records\n
