body	O	9db86b2a	## 책임\nC interface 로 공개되는 비교 결과 값: 비교 범위, 항목 · 관계 차이 행, Kind 별 개수, 지난 시점 항목, 수칙 차이 행 (CR-018). 값 객체다.\n\n타입: DiffRange, ItemDiffRow, RelationDiffRow, KindCounts, ItemVersionView, RuleDiffRecord\n\n## 모듈 인터페이스\n```cpp\n// 함수\nstatic_assert(sizeof(DiffRange) == 8, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(ItemDiffRow) == 36, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(RelationDiffRow) == 48, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(KindCounts) == 24, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(ItemVersionView) == 440, "unexpected padding");\nstatic_assert(sizeof(RuleDiffRecord) == 152, "unexpected padding");\n```\n\n## 멤버 변수\n```cpp\n// DiffRange\nuint32_t from {0};\nuint32_t to {0};\n// ItemDiffRow\nIdText id {};\nuint32_t before {};\nuint32_t after {};\nuint32_t kind {};\nuint32_t change {};\nuint32_t fields {};\n// RelationDiffRow\nIdText from_id {};\nIdText to_id {};\nuint32_t checkpoint {};\nuint32_t relation {};\nuint32_t model {};\nuint32_t change {};\n// KindCounts\nuint32_t added {0};\nuint32_t modified {0};\nuint32_t removed {0};\nuint32_t relations_added {0};\nuint32_t relations_removed {0};\nbool has_decision_change {false};\n// ItemVersionView\nItemLabel label {};\nItemState state {};\nIdText parent_id {};\n// RuleDiffRecord\nTitleText title {};\nIdText id {};\nuint32_t change {0};\nuint32_t changed_fields {0};\n```\n\n## 의존 모듈\n- DSN-058 item_records\n
